        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABCDEBC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AAABCDAB"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"The door's open, I might as well just stroll in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Got some Arnie Palmer in my pitcher, call it Nolan",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Ryan, try it once and then you golden",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I am hopin' that we can kick it, reminiscin' only about the good time",
          "rhyme":"ajm",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I know there's moments when you probably love me, but you didn't wanna show it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Now I'm all around the globe, with everyone but you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I know you fuckin' miss me, chill and keep it cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Never gettin' old, mane, grown, no Rogaine",
          "rhyme":"En",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Fill your plate with all that food, you better eat the whole thing",
          "rhyme":"iN",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"This a family reunion, all the grandmas be movin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Runnin' in three-legged races, people would cry if they losin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"When I was two, my slide was blue",
          "rhyme":"y",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"When I was gone, my ice cream cone was a giant one",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"When my bike was all I was ridin' on",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Jewelry from a Happy Meal, fuck it, I was happy still",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDEFGCHIIJKLM",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCDAEECAFFGHIA"
