    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Come and step inside the Electric Slide",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Sprayin' squirt guns at you like it's pesticide",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"So why you buggin'? Lil' man, stop buggin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I gotta spend some time with some friends of mine",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Get away from everything, go and rest your mind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"It's not nothin', lil' man, it's not nothin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"All my little cousins actin' like some munchkins",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Runnin' into trees, end up cryin' out their eyes",
          "rhyme":"Ej",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Have to rush 'em to the ER, maybe just a Band-Aid will do it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"You can sing along, please let the band play the music",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Always nice you can come back home",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Your friends go off, but then they come back grown",
          "rhyme":"awn",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Nice to know that you never alone",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Family reunions whenever I'm home",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
